OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with arson after hotel
OL,4,Afire near Heathrow
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with arson with
OL,7,Fintent to endanger life after a fire at
OL,8,Fa hotel near Heathrow Airport, police
OL,9,Fhave said.
OL,11,FThe fire broke out at Stanwell Hotel in
OL,12,FStaines, which is used to house asylum
OL,13,Fseekers, at about 09:40 BST on
OL,14,FSaturday.
OL,16,FJake Holder, 28, from Ashford, has been
OL,17,Fremanded in custody and is due to
OL,18,Fappear at Guildford Crown Court on
OL,19,FTuesday, said Surrey Police.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
